# Wipeout HD/Fury handling probe (right sideshift, double-tapped airbrake), the hd-handling lane, 2026-10-08.
#
# Captured on RPCS3 with scripts/rpcs3-trace.py, which holds each state by the
# game's own clock (HD integrates every frame with that frame's delta), from a
# teleport to Talon's Junction grid slot 0 facing +x, after a 60-tick settle:
#
#     uv run --with evdev python3 scripts/rpcs3-trace.py --image <abs iso> \
#         --out data/scratch/<lane>/<boot> --settle 60 --repeat 2 \
#         --nav "Main Menu=right" --nav "Single Player=wait,right" \
#         --nav "Track Creation=wait,right,right,right,right,right,right,right,right" \
#         --run hd-sideshift-right=verification/scenarios/hd-sideshift-right.inputs@6.10,-51.91,-195.92,90
#
# Racebox Time Trial, Venom, Feisar concept1 (team feisar_c1). Our side is the
# same file behind 280 idle ticks (the countdown --race holds the craft for):
#
#     oag-game --no-audio --race --mode time_trial --team feisar_c1 \
#         --variant concept1 --class venom --input-script <280 idle + this> \
#         --ticks <n> --trace-out <csv>
#
# Results and method: docs/physics/hd-handling-ground-truth.md.

90 cross
4 cross r
4 cross
4 cross r
80 cross
